qaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa","endMs":201390,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":201490,"id":"06C6F66D-3D4C-4667-ACAA-F10790AE73A0","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, my Maashooqaa, come stai?","endMs":204620,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, my माशूक़ा, come stai?","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":204720,"id":"DF6B6007-C712-41A1-9A00-BFA690FAFE05","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa","endMs":207940,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":208040,"id":"B4EC9A43-5ECC-4BF1-963F-789E776EF25C","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, my Maashooqaa, come stai?","endMs":211380,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, my माशूक़ा, come stai?","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":211480,"id":"7ADFB9D1-35A3-4423-B7E8-88C116563613","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa","endMs":214650,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":214750,"id":"EF53B461-0944-4E29-ABA7-8788AC37CAA7","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, my Maashooqaa, come stai?","endMs":218229.99999999997,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, my माशूक़ा, come stai?","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":218329.99999999997,"id":"2DA4B149-184D-4226-B328-A5CCDDBB5EF1","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa","endMs":221630,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":221730,"id":"5A5EDDD5-A98E-4DDD-B0D7-02483AC05E3B","transliteratedText":"Maashooqaa, Maashooqaa, my Maashooqaa, come stai?","endMs":223680,"text":"माशूक़ा, माशूक़ा, my माशूक़ा, come stai?","isTransliteratedActive":true},{"startMs":223780,"id":"2A502A97-AF30-408D-89E3-279DFD0D1687","endMs":227780,"text":"(Come get me now)","isTransliteratedActive":false}],"durationMs":230132.97052154195,"fps":30,"title":"mashooqa","templateId":"default with every alignment","typography":{"strokeWidth":3,"color":"#ffffff","glow":54.586476293103445,"fontFamily":"Bebas Neue","hasStroke":false,"fontSize":90.63469827586206,"alignment":"Center","animationStyle":"Fade","strokeColor":"#000000","edgePadding":277.0851293103448},"backgroundURL":"file:\/\/\/Users\/itech\/Library\/Application%20Support\/OneLyricsNative\/35DDBFA3-1EA8-473A-A628-E471DC202AED.jpg","id":"2D1F2815-8118-4FFB-8661-807CBD629EAE","lastModified":812785597.651679,"enableAutoTransliteration":true,"audioURL":"file:\/\/\/var\/folders\/j4\/qqqzvzxn6kzfyls6skv2rfw00000gn\/T\/1DEF6EF9-A29D-4E71-AD4B-5FBE9DBD0161.m4a"},"outputURL":"file:\/\/\/Users\/itech\/Desktop\/mashooqa.mp4","status":"completed","durationMs":230132.97052154195,"id":"BB81D9E2-0964-470B-ACE0-6E637BF77E01","progress":1,"format":"MP4","resolution":"4K","bitrate":"Lossless","priority":1,"completedAt":812824029.314697},{"publishToYouTube":false,"projectName":"line without a hook","createdAt":812827303.223345,"stateSnapshot":{"lyrics":[{"text":"I don't really give a damn about the way you touch me","isTransliteratedActive":false,"endMs":2390,"startMs":540,"id":"4B5D441D-AC50-4165-B5BC-2C62E535DEA1"},{"text":"When we're alone","isTransliteratedActive":false,"endMs":5450,"startMs":2490,"id":"9BC691B7-11AE-4F2A-B675-AD12FBF01EB5"},{"id":"A032203A-0CA6-491C-BAF2-0C91EEA394B2","startMs":5550,"endMs":9450,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"You can hold my hand if no one's home"},{"id":"E64332A6-6080-4ED1-AD1B-B64D9E758875","startMs":9550,"endMs":12610,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Do you like it when I'm away?"},{"id":"BFF7EB26-F77E-4737-BD63-47BC6DE13FAB","startMs":12710,"endMs":14090,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"If I went and hurt my body"},{"id":"381FFB87-A90C-4273-96B7-BA44952AA509","startMs":14190,"endMs":16130,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Baby, would you love me the same?"},{"id":"36EF8191-30CA-4647-B363-2AE78E4C9CF1","startMs":16230,"endMs":20490,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I can feel all my bones coming back, and I'm craving motion"},{"id":"BDD77593-AAFB-4534-A0CD-AE5D3AB840A9","startMs":20590,"endMs":24250,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Mama never really learned how to live by herself"},{"id":"296016EE-C28B-465B-A877-904A6A3E9876","startMs":24350,"endMs":27930,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"It's a curse, and it's growing"},{"id":"833511B7-AA56-4217-AB0C-5489DB9ECE33","startMs":28030,"endMs":32210.000000000004,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"You're a pond and I'm an ocean, oh"},{"id":"941F875D-027A-4794-8149-4B54DD4C9728","startMs":32310.000000000004,"endMs":40620,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"All my emotions feel like explosions when you are around"},{"id":"174C34C2-14EE-48CC-80A4-5CCF2132C201","startMs":40720,"endMs":47190,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"And I've found a way to kill the sound, oh"},{"id":"E395D4AF-0FE0-493D-B884-7104200CCD38","startMs":47290,"endMs":52780,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Oh, baby, I am a wreck when I'm without you"},{"id":"9AF83BC3-61EE-46B9-9655-27EBF8156F60","startMs":52880,"endMs":55760,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I need you here to stay"},{"id":"1ECEC367-C499-4EF3-9425-67469DCED24D","startMs":55860,"endMs":60040,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I broke all my bones that day I found you"},{"id":"B1FB6EA2-89BB-4FC1-BA46-7D7114ECF38E","startMs":60140,"endMs":62620,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Crying at the lake"},{"id":"A96CADAC-2352-4830-A8EA-E66E78733921","startMs":62720,"endMs":69450,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Was it something I said to make you feel like you're a burden?"},{"id":"1DF700C7-61BF-457E-91E6-5DA9FB3EB391","startMs":69550,"endMs":75110.00000000001,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Oh, and if I could take it all back"},{"id":"AFC436C6-4434-4A78-B280-8C016250A81B","startMs":75210.00000000001,"endMs":83790,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I swear that I would pull you from the tide"},{"id":"1E833F40-006C-45F7-8454-A5A227309E15","startMs":83890,"endMs":86860.00000000001,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa!"},{"id":"D9668BE1-4451-4B50-B35E-3D2292275E33","startMs":86960.00000000001,"endMs":89090,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I said no (I said no), I said no (I said no)"},{"id":"F979C194-9A0E-49C8-ADA4-8F73A7C03AB2","startMs":89190,"endMs":93750,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Listen close, it's a no"},{"id":"8F89E3AA-0DA5-4B69-BFE1-B43A1119695E","startMs":93850,"endMs":96280,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"The wind is a-pounding on my back"},{"id":"94B5E00D-A5FA-464D-8A05-781CAAC7B99F","startMs":96380,"endMs":100129.99999999999,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"And I've found hope in a heart attack"},{"id":"D22502B7-8719-45B5-8EB2-314761158C97","startMs":100229.99999999999,"endMs":103450,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Oh, at last, it is past"},{"id":"F31FEE87-A9C9-4E83-823C-41D6E613AE0C","startMs":103550,"endMs":107960,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Now I've got it, and you can't have it"},{"id":"F34793A2-B083-46B9-952F-E07765DA7491","startMs":108060,"endMs":114220,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Baby, I am a wreck when I'm without you"},{"id":"4E4FEBA2-BD52-4B2B-A39A-32C07B329627","startMs":114320,"endMs":116550,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I need you here to stay"},{"id":"3413F208-015A-4B24-A4BC-C91A40ACEBCE","startMs":116650,"endMs":121160,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I broke all my bones that day I found you"},{"id":"90C1327A-3F6D-40FD-9F87-9E9EE5D3E476","startMs":121260,"endMs":123930,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Crying at the lake"},{"id":"6127E7DB-75BB-4FDF-B60B-096A190BADB0","startMs":124030,"endMs":130879.99999999999,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Was it something I said to make you feel like you're a burden?"},{"id":"E3AE27DC-A07B-486A-B0AD-97E050861A68","startMs":130979.99999999999,"endMs":137140,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Oh, and if I could take it all back"},{"id":"CF80D4A7-4611-4372-BCC7-BB2982FB085A","startMs":137240,"endMs":147000,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I swear that I would pull you from the tide"},{"id":"31792E35-8C10-4386-87C9-AA4D779C4BC7","startMs":147100,"endMs":151030,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Darling, when I'm fast asleep"},{"id":"40074E73-3FFF-4E95-9461-70AB06C85E6D","startMs":151130,"endMs":154640,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"I've seen this person watching me"},{"id":"2AD1D084-2809-44BE-85C3-52AE95BBDDE2","startMs":154740,"endMs":158380,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Saying, \"Is it worth it? Is it worth it?"},{"id":"67E038EB-3671-4CC8-9E2E-5E596BBB8046","startMs":158480,"endMs":175260,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"Tell me, is it worth it?\", Oh"},{"id":"5AF7948D-166E-4BE2-BE1D-AA57183E1AD1","startMs":175360,"endMs":180030,"isTransliteratedActive":false,"text":"'Cause there is something and there is nothing"},{"id":"A4CBADB3-5B8D-4D08-ABE3-BC00D449A9DF","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":180130,"text":"There is nothing in between","endMs":183830},{"id":"F0F2F4CE-5E94-476E-9738-47B7C0DDC168","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":183930,"text":"And in my eyes, there is a tiny dancer watching over me","endMs":190080},{"id":"A04ECD07-DE7B-4894-B6D1-F51D09AAC5E9","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":190180,"text":"He's singing, \"She's a, she's a lady, and I am just a boy\"","endMs":197950},{"id":"8AE58A49-0D69-4A50-BA87-BBB463A2CAA1","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":198050,"text":"He's singing, \"She's a, she's a lady, and I am just a line without a-\"","endMs":206550},{"id":"46964C35-D034-4A0B-8849-2E1EA7308BB1","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":206650,"text":"Oh, baby, I am a wreck when I'm without you","endMs":211780},{"id":"CFBE7182-5148-471A-ADDF-4E9F2B86CB29","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":211880,"text":"I need you here to stay","endMs":214720},{"id":"DF174003-701B-4A76-B62C-6B85BBB6B050","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":214820,"text":"Broke all my bones that day I found you","endMs":219510},{"id":"72F7CB85-C868-485D-BD50-41BDE16B0AFC","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":219610,"text":"Crying at the lake","endMs":222220},{"id":"CC5A928B-BF32-461F-807A-B3D63B70FE99","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":222320,"text":"Oh, was it something I said to make you feel like you're a burden?","endMs":229040},{"id":"95726CD1-A1D8-4504-AE9A-BF459103EAFA","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":229140,"text":"Oh, and if I could take it all back","endMs":235560},{"id":"D7B2252A-EE3D-4914-87EE-53782D5450FA","isTransliteratedActive":false,"startMs":235660,"text":"I swear that I would pull you from the tide","endMs":239660}],"backgroundURL":"file:\/\/\/Users\/itech\/Library\/Application%20Support\/OneLyricsNative\/0D642270-6FF6-4392-B111-0F14BC521221.jpg","createdAt":812224677.203182,"showTransliteratedLyrics":true,"fps":30,"audioURL":"file:\/\/\/var\/folders\/j4\/qqqzvzxn6kzfyls6skv2rfw00000gn\/T\/BBA900CE-6A65-4A16-9FD8-7262A92F555C.m4a","durationMs":248034.10430839003,"id":"485E6374-D498-40D4-AB93-9CDFFB889BD6","typography":{"alignment":"Center","strokeColor":"#000000","fontSize":90.63469827586206,"fontFamily":"Bebas Neue","strokeWidth":3,"color":"#ffffff","animationStyle":"Fade","hasStroke":false,"glow":54.586476293103445,"edgePadding":277.0851293103448},"title":"line without a hook","lastModified":812747729.069328,"templateId":"default with every alignment","mediaConfig":{"contrast":1,"brightness":0,"cropOffsetY":-148.37015086206895,"volume":1,"cropOffsetX":0,"bgVolume":0,"cropScale":1.2268318965517242,"saturation":1},"enableAutoTransliteration":true},"outputURL":"file:\/\/\/Users\/itech\/Desktop\/line%20without%20a%20hook.mp4","status":"completed","durationMs":248034.10430839003,"id":"E97DFA52-658D-4110-B9C0-BB8D11EEEF07","progress":1,"format":"MP4","resolution":"4K","bitrate":"Lossless","priority":1,"completedAt":812827440.333503}]